<title>BRAZIL: HSBC to pay 400 mln reais in Bamerindus goodwill.</title>
<headline>HSBC to pay 400 mln reais in Bamerindus goodwill.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong &amp; Shanghai Banking Corp  will pay 400 million reais in goodwill for Brazil's Bamerindus, valued with assets and liabilities of 10 billion reais, said Central Bank director Claudio Mauch.</p>
<p>Mauch told reporters the 400 million reais would be paid into the old Bamerindus bank, which remains under Central Bank intervention.</p>
<p>&quot;HSBC will pay 400 million reais in goodwill for Bamerindus,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Mauch said the part of Bamerindus that HSBC had bought out was worth 10 billion reais.</p>
<p>((--Michael Christie, Brasilia Newsroom, 5511 223 0358))</p>
